<h2>Where should the filters sit on the activity page?</h2>
<p class="subtitle">Same three controls in each: event type (nine checkboxes), date range presets, failed sign-ins only. Wireframes only, not final styling.</p>

<div class="cards">
  <div class="card" data-choice="a" onclick="toggleSelect(this)">
    <div class="card-image">
      <div class="mockup">
        <div class="mockup-header">A. Filter panel above the table</div>
        <div class="mockup-body">
          <div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px">Account activity</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;margin-bottom:8px">Every sign-in and account change from the last 90 days, newest first.</div>
          <div class="placeholder" style="text-align:left;padding:8px">
            <div style="display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap">
              <div><div class="label">Event type</div>
                <div style="font-size:11px;columns:2">[x] Sign-in<br>[x] Sign-in failed<br>[x] Sign-out<br>[x] Session expired<br>[x] Password changed<br>[x] Two-factor enabled<br>[x] Email change requested<br>[x] Settings updated<br>[x] API token used</div></div>
              <div><div class="label">Date range</div><input class="mock-input" value="Last 90 days" style="width:110px"></div>
            </div>
            <button class="mock-button" style="margin-top:6px">Failed sign-ins only</button>
          </div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;margin:6px 0">48 of 48 events</div>
          <div class="placeholder">Table: When / Event / Device / Location / IP / Details</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body">
      <h3>A. Always-visible panel</h3>
      <p>Everything visible at once, no extra click. Takes about a third of the first screen before any rows.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" data-choice="b" onclick="toggleSelect(this)">
    <div class="card-image">
      <div class="mockup">
        <div class="mockup-header">B. Compact bar + popover for event types</div>
        <div class="mockup-body">
          <div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px">Account activity</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;margin-bottom:8px">Every sign-in and account change from the last 90 days, newest first.</div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap">
            <div><div class="label">Date range</div><input class="mock-input" value="Last 90 days" style="width:110px"></div>
            <button class="mock-button">Event type (all) v</button>
            <button class="mock-button">Failed sign-ins only</button>
          </div>
          <div style="font-size:11px;margin:6px 0">Active: [Sign-in failed x] [Last 7 days x]</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;margin:6px 0">5 of 48 events</div>
          <div class="placeholder">Table: When / Event / Device / Location / IP / Details</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body">
      <h3>B. One row, checkboxes in a popover</h3>
      <p>Table starts sooner; active filters shown as removable tags (02 Tag + Popover). Type list is one click away; more JS for open/close, focus and Escape.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
